<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Hamedi 2</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    direction: rtl;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;

    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;

    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #434343, #000000);
}

.box {
    width: 90%;
    max-width: 500px;
    padding: 50px 30px;
    text-align: center;

    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);

    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    border-radius: 30px;

    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);

    animation: appear 0.8s ease;
}

h1 {
    color: white;
    font-size: 45px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

p {
    color: #ccc;
    font-size: 20px;
}

.emoji {
    font-size: 55px;
    animation: shake 1s infinite;
}

@keyframes shake {
    0%,100% {
        transform: rotate(0);
    }

    25% {
        transform: rotate(-10deg);
    }

    75% {
        transform: rotate(10deg);
    }
}

@keyframes appear {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: scale(0.7);
    }

    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scale(1);
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="box">

    <div class="emoji">🖕🏻</div>

    <h1>سیکتیر</h1>
    <p> ایشاله وقتی اب میخوری اب دهنت بپره تو گلوت خفه شی بمیری،سگ</p>

</div>

</body>
</html>